<title>USA: Ambassador Apartments names new president.</title>
<headline>Ambassador Apartments names new president.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ambassador Apartments Inc said Tuesday it appointed Debra Cafaro its new president and a member of its board of directors, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Cafaro, a founding partner at a Chicago law firm that specializes in real estate and finance, succeeds Richard Cavenaugh, who left the company in December, an Ambassador Apartments spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>Cafaro's appointment restores the size of the company's board to eight members, the spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>Ambassador Apartments is a real estate investment trust.</p>
<p>Its shares closed off 1/4 Tuesday at 24.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
